# CODEOWNERS: "every gate has a named owner".
# GitHub requests a review from the owner when a PR touches their files.
# Later lines win over earlier ones. Replace the usernames with your team's (scripts/init.sh does this).
#
# To make owner approval REQUIRED: Settings → Branches → add a rule for main →
# "Require a pull request before merging" → "Require review from Code Owners".
# Only turn that on for teams: on a solo project you can't approve your own PR.

